@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Giriş Yap ve JWT Token Al (Örnek Müşteri 1)
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmet.yilmaz@banka.com",
  "identityNumber": "12345678901"
}

### Token'ı Değişkene Ata
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. Yeni Müşteri Kaydı Oluştur
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mehmet",
  "lastName": "Kaya",
  "email": "mehmet.kaya@banka.com",
  "identityNumber": "55544433321"
}

### 3. Tüm Müşterileri Listele (Yetkili)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Belirli Müşteri Bilgilerini Getir
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{login.response.body.customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Yeni Banka Hesabı Aç (TRY)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{login.response.body.customerId}}",
  "currency": 1,
  "initialBalance": 5000
}

### 6. Hesaba Para Yatır
# Not: <ACCOUNT_ID> yerine sistemdeki geçerli bir hesap GUID'si yazınız.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/<ACCOUNT_ID>/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500,
  "description": "Nakit Gişe Yatırma"
}

### 7. Hesap Bakiyesini Sorgula
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/<ACCOUNT_ID>/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Hesaplar Arası Atomik Transfer (TransferMoneyCommand)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "<SOURCE_ACCOUNT_ID>",
  "targetAccountId": "<TARGET_ACCOUNT_ID>",
  "amount": 250,
  "description": "Fatura Paylaşımı Transferi"
}

### 9. Hesap Hareketlerini Listele
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/<ACCOUNT_ID>/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
